QQIf83f9xxfNG0OAEtAcwMP_hlbOVHcUlrRiuQ4AQ77HQ&oe=6B0DB7B4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "38974528_530368138367332_2336341706688924385_n.png", "id": "847264866246863", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974526_847264869580196_3000404448788090664_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KCrngiawRdgQ7kNvwHwrx-G&_nc_oc=AdpkNTwErfnoYkO1XwVBtWisdn2QUNHmWQRkh5KmRh62SDIbTUAEKCrokivCquz5YJE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSIwjTnGeM_cWLiseGs6XRSFuVV2fY0VGzKr1YnaaFrxQ&oe=6B0D9BFB"}, "display_name": "MOON", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Experience MOON - a gripping musical journey through the unknowable cosmos. Built from the ground up, this VR experience will take you through eerie celestial environments guided by spatial audio and a surround sound adventure you won\u2019t forget. \n\n-Fully rendered real-time environments\n-Spatialized environment audio combined with ambisonic surround music\n-7 minutes of a gritty and psychedelic sci-fi journey\n-Sinister story of what happens when humanity attempts to know the unknowable\n\nCredits:\nCode/Art - Jeff Bull Jr\nArt - Trey Stimpson\nAudio - Dara Crawford\n\nMusic Credits:\nComposition/Production - Dara Crawford\nVocals - Zamm Kenoby\nDrums - Darren Doherty\nGuitars - Jeff Bull Jr\n\nSpecial Thanks\nHand Rigging - Jeremy Wynn", "short_description": "Experience MOON - a gripping musical journey through the unknowable cosmos. Built from the ground up, this VR experience will take you through eerie celestial environments guided by spatial audio and a surround sound adventure you won\u2019t forget. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1irUW7njChPPFH8sAcFzEr-ji7RzGh050kHOh_vM44Yw/edit", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Don't Look Digital", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://dontlook.digital/"